{"seq":3,"slug":"systems-view","title":"系统化性能观","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-engineering-intro/systems-view","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"latency-decomposition","title":"端到端延迟分解与瓶颈转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-engineering-intro/systems-view/latency-decomposition","wordCount":2682,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"queueing-utilization","title":"排队效应与利用率陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-engineering-intro/systems-view/queueing-utilization","wordCount":2875,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"tradeoff-thinking","title":"从单点优化到系统权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/performance-engineering-intro/systems-view/tradeoff-thinking","wordCount":2864,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"系统化性能观\">系统化性能观</h1><p>上一章给了你一条具体链路和一个具体案例。本章要做的是从案例里抽出来，问一个更根本的问题：当一条链路出问题时，你凭什么知道该动哪里？这个问题不能靠经验和直觉回答——链路上有几十个环节，凭感觉挑一个去优化，命中瓶颈的概率很低。本章给出的是三件能替代直觉的工具。</p>\n<p>第 1 篇讲端到端延迟分解与瓶颈转移。核心是两件事：怎么正确地分解（先定义端点，再取分位样本而不是均值，然后把未插桩的等待也画进时间线），以及为什么优化后总时间的下降总是小于被优化段的耗时——瓶颈会沿数据流移动，优化会兜圈，但每圈的水位都在抬高。这一篇也给出可复用的六步分解模板，以及「追踪树上自己耗时过大通常意味着排队而非代码慢」这个高频误读的识别方法。</p>\n<p>第 2 篇讲排队效应与利用率陷阱，这是本课程数学密度最高的一篇。它解释了为什么延迟随利用率以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸式增长、为什么服务时间的波动会同比放大等待时间、为什么「70% 安全线」是有条件而不是普遍的、以及如何用 Little 定律从实测数据反推容量和发现「看不见的排队」。这一篇的实操价值在于它把容量决策从经验判断变成可计算的问题：要不要扩容、限流阈值设多少、优化能省多少机器，三个日常问题都有对应的算式。</p>\n<p>第 3 篇讲从单点优化到系统权衡：Amdahl 定律给出的收益上限、通过共享计算/缓存/下游配额/网络这四类通道发生的耦合反噬、把权衡建模成约束优化的方法，以及一次完整权衡决策必须回答的四个问题。它处理的是一类最隐蔽的失败：技术上的优化在组织层面无法存活，因为反噬的成本落在别的团队而没有被显式讨论。</p>\n<p>三篇的关系是「诊断 → 容量 → 决策」。第 1 篇解决「瓶颈在哪」，第 2 篇解决「还有多少空间」，第 3 篇解决「动哪里、代价是什么」。三篇合起来构成一套可以独立使用的分析方法：给定一个性能问题，你能分解它、能判断它是否接近容量极限、能列出候选方案与反噬并选出可执行的组合；三个步骤都不需要依赖具体技术栈。</p>\n<p>本章的定位是方法层，因此它刻意不绑定任何技术。案例仍然是上一章的搜索链路，但它只作为例子出现，重点是方法本身。本章也是后续 Tier 3（前端、BFF、搜索引擎、排序、AI 搜索各自的分层优化）和 Tier 4（容量规划、SLO 与文化）的方法前置：Tier 3 的每一篇都在用本章的分解与权衡方法，Tier 4 的容量规划直接建在第 2 篇的排队模型之上。</p>\n<p>前置上需要上一章的案例认知，以及能读懂简单的公式。本章出现的三个公式——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\max_i f_i(u_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（延迟由最紧张资源决定）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q = \\rho S/(1-\\rho) \\cdot (1+C_S^2)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">ρS</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>（含波动放大的排队等待）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>（Little 定律）——都在正文内逐步推导并配了数值例子，不要求预先学过排队论。如果第 2 篇的数学让你不适，建议先读第 1、3 篇，把第 2 篇的结论（曲棍球杆、拐点法、在途数反推）当作工具使用，之后再回来读推导。</p>\n"}